  "project_description": "Arch is an e-commerce Drupal module suite. The base `arch` module is the store dashboard and admin umbrella: it registers the /admin/store dashboard (a plugin-driven panel page), the 'administer store' permission, store content settings (Terms & Conditions / Privacy Policy links on checkout), and an admin-theme toggle for store administration. The commerce feature set is delivered by 24 submodules covering products, prices, cart, checkout, orders, payment (incl. Saferpay), shipping, stock, discounts and statistics.",
